      "writtenOn": "2018-01-18T10:07:21Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "A less verbose alternative might be to create an @hide BaseNetdEventCallback that provides no-op methods.  See BaseNetworkObserver for an example.\n\nThen we can inherit from that and only override the one function we care about.  This will help the other users of INetdEventCallback (which would otherwise also need to be extended I think).",
      "range": {
